- Growth factor impact on performance
- Cache locality during bulk copies

## Code Example

```javascript
let cap = 1, n = 0, arr = new Array(cap);
function append(x) {
  if (n === cap) {
    const newCap = cap * 2;
    const tmp = new Array(newCap);
    for (let i = 0; i < n; i++) tmp[i] = arr[i];
    arr = tmp; cap = newCap;
  }
  arr[n++] = x;
}
```

